"P3426220964" "Anti-Matter has begun using the Keyes Island reactors as weapons, manipulating the reactor's magnetic containment system to increase the intensity of the antimatter reactions and drive radiation into the Underground. The Resistance, and your own allies, are threatened by this dramatic surge in radiation, but there remains the possibility that Anti-Matter could go too far, pushing the reactor into a critical state from which it would never recover. This would have devastating consequences for all of Praetorian Earth.<br><br>If Anti-Matter is to be stopped before any more damage is done, you will have to take control over the reactors away from him. This starts by re-establishing the full strength of the magnetic containment system that shields the world from the reactions within the reactor.<br><br>Around the reactor are ten terminals which are used to control and shape the magnetic containment field within the reactor. All of these terminals have been disabled and their power reserves drained. You and your team need to recover Power Cells from around the reactor and use them on the Control Terminals. Each Terminal requires 3 Power Cells before it is fully charged and operational. Anti-Matter will not take your interference lightly, so be prepared to deal with his personal army of War Works and, eventually, with him."
