"P721056193" "With Reactor Hope under your control, your attentions have turned to Reactor Genesis. Here, Anti-Matter has summoned Goliath War Walkers to quickly recover the Power Cells found around the reactor and remove them to a safe area. Throughout this fight, these Goliaths and their escort teams will be fleeing the area. If you hope to acquire the Power Cells necessary to restore Reactor Genesis' containment system, you will need to defeat the Goliaths. Each Goliath will drop at least two Power Cells, with a chance for a third."
