"P2723626879" "With Reactor Hope and Reactor Genesis under your control, only one reactor remains to be claimed: Reactor Infinity, to the southeast. Here, the remaining Warworks in Anti-Matter's army have locked away the Power Cell containers within three bunkers. Two of these bunkers are found to the northeast of the Reactor, while the third is located in the southwest corner. If you hope to acquire the Power Cells necessary to restore Reactor Infinity's containment system, you will need to penetrate the bunkers and extract the Power Cells from the containers within."
